  "description": "A senior navy officer serving the extremist politician: the Admiral is skilled but, above all, loyal to Robespierre. He has served in numerous campaigns, climbing little by little up the hierarchy. During one of his battles, he saved a young woman who had been attacked by a group of Shapeshifters with dark intentions. The two ended up falling in love. However, Nelson was unaware at the time that his partner was also a Shapeshifter. Their relationship would, as a result, become a dark secret. Although he accepts the orders he’s given, his perspective on Shapeshifters might indeed be different from the man under whom he serves.",
